READ ME

Ancestral State Reconstruction.R is the code file used for the analyses in R.

GroupNames.csv states all species names in the analysis.

ConsensusTree.nex - The consensus tree.

AncestralStates.csv - Column 1: Species Names. Column 2: Egg Colour State where 1 = Transparent, 2 = Carotenoid, 3 = Green, 4 = Guanine and 5 = Melanin.
